{
  "$description": "SEMANTIC colour tokens (intent layer) — re-based from Figma native export (collection 'semantic-color', modes 'light' & 'dark'). LIVE tokens only; 147 deprecated tokens excluded (see _manifests/depricate-tokens.json). Each leaf carries light/dark resolved hex + the brand primitive each mode aliases to. Source: _raw/semantic-color/{light,dark}.tokens.json. Sutherland-light remap deltas: see _manifests/sutherland-diffs.json.",
